```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Owner {
        +str owner_id
        +str name
        +list pets
        +add_pet(pet)
        +remove_pet(pet_id)
    }

    class Pet {
        +str pet_id
        +str name
        +str species
        +list tasks
        +add_task(task)
        +get_tasks()
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +str task_type
        +int duration
        +str priority
        +bool completed
        +mark_completed()
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +list tasks
        +int available_time
        +schedule_task(task)
        +sort_tasks()
        +detect_conflicts()
        +generate_daily_plan()
    }

    Owner "1" --> "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Task : manages
```